{"source": "/home/ubuntu/shiva-study-set/Shiva Sutras 3.26.mp3", "engine": "faster-whisper-base", "segments": [{"t": 0.11, "end": 3.11, "text": "Shirdi Rathi Yeruratam."}, {"t": 3.11, "end": 6.11, "text": "This maintenance of his body"}, {"t": 6.11, "end": 9.11, "text": "years his virtuous behaviour."}, {"t": 9.11, "end": 12.11, "text": "This virtuous behaviour, for instance,"}, {"t": 12.11, "end": 15.11, "text": "there was eclipse of moon."}, {"t": 15.11, "end": 18.11, "text": "We had observed that virtuous behaviour, fasting"}, {"t": 18.11, "end": 21.11, "text": "and everything until that moon was"}, {"t": 21.11, "end": 23.11, "text": "relieved from that"}, {"t": 23.11, "end": 26.11, "text": "glass of that Rahu."}, {"t": 26.11, "end": 29.11, "text": "This is called virtuous behaviour."}, {"t": 29.11, "end": 32.11, "text": "But for such a Yogi, virtuous behaviour,"}, {"t": 32.11, "end": 35.11, "text": "he is just to remain in body as it is."}, {"t": 35.11, "end": 39.11, "text": "For instance, getting"}, {"t": 39.11, "end": 43.11, "text": "from bed at four,"}, {"t": 43.11, "end": 46.11, "text": "going to bathroom,"}, {"t": 46.11, "end": 48.11, "text": "then taking bed tea,"}, {"t": 48.11, "end": 54.64, "text": "going for work, food, lunch,"}, {"t": 54.64, "end": 57.64, "text": "gardening, everything, cleaning."}, {"t": 57.64, "end": 61.64, "text": "All this is his virtuous behaviour."}, {"t": 61.64, "end": 64.64, "text": "There is no need for him"}, {"t": 64.64, "end": 67.64, "text": "to maintain virtuous behaviour"}, {"t": 67.64, "end": 71.64, "text": "other than this, other than this happening."}, {"t": 71.64, "end": 74.64, "text": "So his ordinary talk of life,"}, {"t": 74.64, "end": 77.64, "text": "he is taking tea, he is going for work,"}, {"t": 77.64, "end": 80.64, "text": "cinema, picture, everything, this is his virtuous behaviour"}, {"t": 80.64, "end": 83.64, "text": "in his remaining period of life."}, {"t": 83.64, "end": 86.64, "text": "This is what he says in this Sutra,"}, {"t": 86.64, "end": 91.04, "text": "Shri Ravratam."}, {"t": 91.04, "end": 93.04, "text": "Prokta Dresha, Shiva, tulle siyogina."}, {"t": 93.04, "end": 95.04, "text": "For whom, for such a Yogi,"}, {"t": 95.04, "end": 97.04, "text": "who is just like Shiva?"}, {"t": 97.04, "end": 99.04, "text": "Shiva, humbhavena, vartamānasiya."}, {"t": 99.04, "end": 101.04, "text": "It means in other words,"}, {"t": 101.04, "end": 103.04, "text": "whose consciousness,"}, {"t": 103.04, "end": 105.04, "text": "eye consciousness,"}, {"t": 105.04, "end": 107.04, "text": "is just like Shiva consciousness."}, {"t": 107.04, "end": 111.51, "text": "For him, Shri Ravratamya,"}, {"t": 111.51, "end": 114.51, "text": "the existence in his physical frame"}, {"t": 114.51, "end": 117.51, "text": "is just like Shiva consciousness."}, {"t": 117.51, "end": 120.51, "text": "This is his virtuous behaviour."}, {"t": 120.51, "end": 123.51, "text": "Just to exist in his body."}, {"t": 123.51, "end": 125.51, "text": "This is virtuous behaviour."}, {"t": 125.51, "end": 128.51, "text": "How nicely he has explained it."}, {"t": 128.51, "end": 131.51, "text": "So Surupevamarshātmaka nityojit,"}, {"t": 131.51, "end": 135.51, "text": "parapuja atatparasya ne mein anishtaya masyaa."}, {"t": 135.51, "end": 139.51, "text": "Because he is bent upon performing"}, {"t": 139.51, "end": 142.51, "text": "the supreme worship of Lord Shiva"}, {"t": 142.51, "end": 145.51, "text": "in each and every action of his life."}, {"t": 145.51, "end": 148.51, "text": "While eating, while drinking,"}, {"t": 148.51, "end": 151.51, "text": "while talking, while taking tea,"}, {"t": 151.51, "end": 155.11, "text": "while taking lunch,"}, {"t": 155.11, "end": 158.11, "text": "while beating his servant,"}, {"t": 158.11, "end": 163.11, "text": "he does his supreme worship of Lord Shiva,"}, {"t": 163.11, "end": 165.11, "text": "nothing else."}, {"t": 165.11, "end": 167.11, "text": "Tathājya is such a day."}, {"t": 167.11, "end": 169.11, "text": "This is a day of such a day."}, {"t": 169.11, "end": 172.11, "text": "Although everybody says"}, {"t": 172.11, "end": 175.11, "text": "we are acting just like ordinary,"}, {"t": 175.11, "end": 177.11, "text": "ordinary individual being."}, {"t": 177.11, "end": 179.11, "text": "He is not acting like that."}, {"t": 179.11, "end": 181.11, "text": "He is somewhere else."}, {"t": 181.11, "end": 183.11, "text": "Yes?"}, {"t": 183.11, "end": 188.11, "text": "For this, he gives another reference of Shastra."}, {"t": 188.11, "end": 191.11, "text": "So Supradev te vieta vahnav,"}, {"t": 191.11, "end": 193.11, "text": "shikha dreshe te chambare,"}, {"t": 193.11, "end": 197.11, "text": "dehe prānas chidho piathma tathvat liye tath padhe."}, {"t": 197.11, "end": 202.94, "text": "Whenever fire takes place,"}, {"t": 202.94, "end": 207.25, "text": "fire gets lighted."}, {"t": 207.25, "end": 213.42, "text": "Fire takes place."}, {"t": 213.42, "end": 216.42, "text": "When fire is lit,"}, {"t": 216.42, "end": 218.42, "text": "when fire is lit,"}, {"t": 218.42, "end": 219.42, "text": "shikha dreshe te,"}, {"t": 219.42, "end": 221.42, "text": "where are the flames?"}, {"t": 221.42, "end": 223.42, "text": "Flames are seen in the sky."}, {"t": 223.42, "end": 225.42, "text": "Fire is on the ground."}, {"t": 225.42, "end": 227.42, "text": "The flames are in the sky."}, {"t": 227.42, "end": 230.42, "text": "In the same way, dehe prānas chidho piathma."}, {"t": 230.42, "end": 233.42, "text": "This body of such a yogi"}, {"t": 233.42, "end": 236.42, "text": "is existing in the inferior feet of individuality."}, {"t": 237.42, "end": 240.42, "text": "But actually he is in that God conscious."}, {"t": 240.42, "end": 242.42, "text": "He is established in that God conscious."}, {"t": 242.42, "end": 245.42, "text": "Just like that flame in fire."}, {"t": 245.42, "end": 251.42, "text": "Just the flame of fire in upper sphere of ether."}, {"t": 251.42, "end": 254.42, "text": "Yatya dhukta dehe prānas chidho piathma."}, {"t": 254.42, "end": 257.42, "text": "Although he is existing,"}, {"t": 257.42, "end": 261.42, "text": "residing in the state of dehe prānas chidho piathma."}, {"t": 261.42, "end": 263.42, "text": "All these inferior states,"}, {"t": 263.42, "end": 266.42, "text": "but Shiva sāmaa viṣṭat-tamukhtam."}, {"t": 266.42, "end": 267.42, "text": "He has entered."}, {"t": 267.42, "end": 271.42, "text": "He has got attained entry in Shiva already."}, {"t": 271.42, "end": 273.42, "text": "He has entered in Shiva."}, {"t": 273.42, "end": 276.42, "text": "So you must not calculate by his actions,"}, {"t": 276.42, "end": 281.42, "text": "by his actions just like our actions."}, {"t": 281.42, "end": 285.42, "text": "So he must not be fully aware of God consciousness."}, {"t": 285.42, "end": 288.42, "text": "He is just like us."}, {"t": 288.42, "end": 292.08, "text": "You must not think like that."}, {"t": 293.08, "end": 295.08, "text": "Because he is somewhere else."}, {"t": 295.08, "end": 298.08, "text": "If he does all these things, he is somewhere else."}, {"t": 298.08, "end": 301.32, "text": "He is above."}, {"t": 301.32, "end": 305.32, "text": "Nāpunas tāśya diha-stheti vidraktam vratam upu yuktam."}, {"t": 305.32, "end": 308.32, "text": "He has no other,"}, {"t": 308.32, "end": 314.69, "text": "that another virtuous behavior,"}, {"t": 314.69, "end": 318.69, "text": "except than this diha-stheti,"}, {"t": 318.69, "end": 321.69, "text": "remaining in this deha,"}, {"t": 321.69, "end": 324.69, "text": "in this physical frame and its action."}, {"t": 324.69, "end": 327.69, "text": "Deho tithābi, mudrabi,"}, {"t": 327.69, "end": 329.69, "text": "yasadā mudhṛtobuddha,"}, {"t": 329.69, "end": 335.67, "text": "sattu mudra-dhara-prūkhta-śeṣya-vaya-asthikdhāra-ka."}, {"t": 335.67, "end": 339.67, "text": "By the behaviors of body,"}, {"t": 339.67, "end": 342.67, "text": "mudrabi, by the behaviors of body,"}, {"t": 342.67, "end": 345.67, "text": "which have come out from body."}, {"t": 345.67, "end": 348.67, "text": "Behaviors, what do you mean by behaviors?"}, {"t": 348.67, "end": 350.67, "text": "What do you understand by behaviors?"}, {"t": 350.67, "end": 351.67, "text": "Actions."}, {"t": 351.67, "end": 354.67, "text": "Taking tea, going to bed,"}, {"t": 354.67, "end": 358.67, "text": "taking rest, talking, joking,"}, {"t": 358.67, "end": 363.67, "text": "taking light or going here and there, walking,"}, {"t": 363.67, "end": 367.84, "text": "resting."}, {"t": 367.84, "end": 368.84, "text": "These are mudra."}, {"t": 368.84, "end": 369.84, "text": "These are behaviors."}, {"t": 369.84, "end": 371.84, "text": "By these behaviors,"}, {"t": 371.84, "end": 375.84, "text": "who is impressed or sealed?"}, {"t": 375.84, "end": 377.84, "text": "Yasadā mudhṛtobuddha,"}, {"t": 377.84, "end": 383.84, "text": "the one who is always sealed or impressed by these."}, {"t": 384.84, "end": 386.84, "text": "Sattu mudhṛtobuddha,"}, {"t": 386.84, "end": 390.84, "text": "he is the real holder of mudras."}, {"t": 390.84, "end": 392.84, "text": "He is the real holder of all mudras,"}, {"t": 392.84, "end": 395.84, "text": "all postures of yoga."}, {"t": 395.84, "end": 398.84, "text": "Seṣya-vaya-asthikdhāra-ka."}, {"t": 398.84, "end": 401.84, "text": "All others, all other yogis,"}, {"t": 401.84, "end": 403.84, "text": "who are not like him,"}, {"t": 403.84, "end": 409.84, "text": "they only hold bundle of bones with them."}, {"t": 410.84, "end": 414.84, "text": "Asthi. Asthi means bundle of bones."}, {"t": 414.84, "end": 416.84, "text": "They have got bones,"}, {"t": 416.84, "end": 419.84, "text": "marrow, flesh,"}, {"t": 419.84, "end": 421.84, "text": "in body, nothing else."}, {"t": 421.84, "end": 424.84, "text": "But his body has no flesh,"}, {"t": 424.84, "end": 426.84, "text": "no bones,"}, {"t": 426.84, "end": 427.84, "text": "he is supreme,"}, {"t": 427.84, "end": 429.84, "text": "he is one with God consciousness."}, {"t": 429.84, "end": 431.84, "text": "You must not think that he is in body,"}, {"t": 431.84, "end": 432.84, "text": "with flesh and with bone,"}, {"t": 432.84, "end": 435.84, "text": "with all that stuff."}, {"t": 435.84, "end": 438.84, "text": "He is something supreme."}, {"t": 438.84, "end": 440.84, "text": "This is what he explains here."}, {"t": 440.84, "end": 442.84, "text": "Srikulu-panch-shikāyāma-pi,"}, {"t": 442.84, "end": 444.84, "text": "in another shastra,"}, {"t": 444.84, "end": 447.84, "text": "Srikulu-panch-shikāyit-sidh."}, {"t": 447.84, "end": 453.44, "text": "Avyākta-lingyānām-dreśto-ā-sambhāshant-te-mari-jaya."}, {"t": 453.44, "end": 455.44, "text": "Mari-jaya means all these"}, {"t": 455.44, "end": 459.44, "text": "masses of energies, energies of Lord Shiva."}, {"t": 459.44, "end": 462.44, "text": "There are Lord Shiva's energies"}, {"t": 462.44, "end": 468.17, "text": "are classified in three ways."}, {"t": 468.17, "end": 470.17, "text": "One class of energies is"}, {"t": 470.17, "end": 472.17, "text": "the second is"}, {"t": 472.17, "end": 476.17, "text": "inter-between medium class of energies."}, {"t": 476.17, "end": 479.17, "text": "The third is inferior class of energies."}, {"t": 479.17, "end": 483.17, "text": "Inferior class of energies are bent upon"}, {"t": 483.17, "end": 488.17, "text": "making an individual"}, {"t": 488.17, "end": 493.17, "text": "enter in the depth of darkness of ignorance."}, {"t": 493.17, "end": 496.17, "text": "This is the action"}, {"t": 497.17, "end": 502.17, "text": "functioned by inferior class of energies."}, {"t": 502.17, "end": 503.17, "text": "Gore-tiri."}, {"t": 503.17, "end": 507.17, "text": "These are called Gore-tiri energies."}, {"t": 507.17, "end": 512.22, "text": "The medium class of energies"}, {"t": 512.22, "end": 516.22, "text": "are called Gore energies."}, {"t": 516.22, "end": 517.22, "text": "Goras."}, {"t": 517.22, "end": 520.22, "text": "They just make you stand still"}, {"t": 520.22, "end": 524.22, "text": "and don't allow you to go up"}, {"t": 524.22, "end": 525.22, "text": "in God consciousness,"}, {"t": 525.22, "end": 527.22, "text": "in the state of God consciousness."}, {"t": 527.22, "end": 530.22, "text": "This is another class of energies."}, {"t": 530.22, "end": 532.22, "text": "The first class of energies is"}, {"t": 532.22, "end": 535.22, "text": "para-sprim-agore class of energies."}, {"t": 535.22, "end": 538.22, "text": "That agore class of energies"}, {"t": 538.22, "end": 540.22, "text": "is attached here in this locum."}, {"t": 540.22, "end": 544.22, "text": "Avyākta-lingyānām-dreśto-ā-sambhāshant-te-mari-jaya."}, {"t": 544.22, "end": 546.22, "text": "Those first class energies"}, {"t": 546.22, "end": 549.22, "text": "of God consciousness that agore-shaktis"}, {"t": 549.22, "end": 553.82, "text": "embrace that yogi"}, {"t": 553.82, "end": 555.82, "text": "who is absolutely"}, {"t": 555.82, "end": 560.48, "text": "not known to anybody."}, {"t": 560.48, "end": 562.48, "text": "Who is absolutely not known"}, {"t": 562.48, "end": 564.48, "text": "whose way of life"}, {"t": 564.48, "end": 569.48, "text": "takes place in such a way"}, {"t": 569.48, "end": 571.48, "text": "that he is not known to anybody"}, {"t": 571.48, "end": 572.48, "text": "as yogi."}, {"t": 572.48, "end": 576.11, "text": "Everybody says that he is just like"}, {"t": 576.11, "end": 577.11, "text": "bogey."}, {"t": 577.11, "end": 578.11, "text": "He is nothing."}, {"t": 578.11, "end": 581.11, "text": "He has no supremacy in him."}, {"t": 581.11, "end": 584.11, "text": "He is just ordinary person"}, {"t": 584.11, "end": 585.11, "text": "because he talks,"}, {"t": 585.11, "end": 587.11, "text": "he walks just like us."}, {"t": 587.11, "end": 590.11, "text": "That is Avyākta-lingyānām-dreśto him"}, {"t": 590.11, "end": 592.11, "text": "that masses of energies,"}, {"t": 592.11, "end": 594.11, "text": "that agore,"}, {"t": 594.11, "end": 595.11, "text": "agore, agore,"}, {"t": 595.11, "end": 597.11, "text": "that supreme energies"}, {"t": 597.11, "end": 599.11, "text": "embrace always."}, {"t": 599.11, "end": 601.11, "text": "So he is always carried"}, {"t": 601.11, "end": 602.11, "text": "to that God consciousness"}, {"t": 602.11, "end": 605.11, "text": "and is established there forever."}, {"t": 605.11, "end": 606.11, "text": "Lingyānām-dreśto-ā-sambhāshant-te-mari-jaya."}, {"t": 606.11, "end": 608.11, "text": "Lingyānām-dreśto-ā-sambhāshant-te-mari-jaya."}, {"t": 608.11, "end": 610.11, "text": "The one who is known to everybody,"}, {"t": 610.11, "end": 612.11, "text": "the one the yogi"}, {"t": 612.11, "end": 613.11, "text": "who is known to everybody"}, {"t": 613.11, "end": 614.11, "text": "that he is yogi,"}, {"t": 614.11, "end": 616.11, "text": "he is first class yogi."}, {"t": 616.11, "end": 619.11, "text": "To him those energies"}, {"t": 619.11, "end": 622.11, "text": "keep away from him."}, {"t": 622.11, "end": 624.11, "text": "They never touch him."}, {"t": 624.11, "end": 626.11, "text": "So he is carried away"}, {"t": 626.11, "end": 627.11, "text": "from God consciousness."}, {"t": 627.11, "end": 631.36, "text": "So it is very good that"}, {"t": 631.36, "end": 634.36, "text": "a yogi should behave in such a way"}, {"t": 634.36, "end": 636.36, "text": "that he is not known"}, {"t": 636.36, "end": 638.36, "text": "to public as yogi."}, {"t": 638.36, "end": 640.36, "text": "He must be known to public"}, {"t": 640.36, "end": 642.36, "text": "as ordinary person."}, {"t": 642.36, "end": 647.77, "text": "This is the secret of rise."}, {"t": 648.77, "end": 653.2, "text": "Because atigūpta-tara-yata,"}, {"t": 653.2, "end": 657.2, "text": "this state of God consciousness"}, {"t": 657.2, "end": 662.48, "text": "has come forth"}, {"t": 662.48, "end": 667.48, "text": "from secret point"}, {"t": 667.48, "end": 671.48, "text": "and is residing in secret way of life."}, {"t": 671.48, "end": 674.48, "text": "So you must keep it secret."}, {"t": 674.48, "end": 676.48, "text": "Don't give it publicity."}, {"t": 676.48, "end": 680.48, "text": "As long as you don't give your state"}, {"t": 680.48, "end": 682.48, "text": "of spiritual state,"}, {"t": 682.48, "end": 685.48, "text": "publicity, you are there."}, {"t": 685.48, "end": 687.48, "text": "Otherwise you are carried away."}, {"t": 687.48, "end": 690.48, "text": "You are away from that God consciousness."}, {"t": 690.48, "end": 694.18, "text": "Don't you understand?"}, {"t": 694.18, "end": 696.18, "text": "When you understand everybody understands."}, {"t": 696.18, "end": 699.18, "text": "Not to disciple also."}, {"t": 699.18, "end": 701.18, "text": "Not to disciple also."}, {"t": 701.18, "end": 703.18, "text": "He must not be known."}, {"t": 703.18, "end": 705.18, "text": "He must behave in such a way"}, {"t": 705.18, "end": 707.18, "text": "that he is absolutely conceived."}, {"t": 707.18, "end": 711.18, "text": "He conceals that his power of spirituality"}, {"t": 711.18, "end": 713.18, "text": "within his nature"}, {"t": 713.18, "end": 716.18, "text": "and doesn't give it any exposure"}, {"t": 716.18, "end": 718.18, "text": "to public."}, {"t": 718.18, "end": 720.18, "text": "Disappel must have faith blindly."}, {"t": 720.18, "end": 722.18, "text": "This is blind faith."}, {"t": 722.18, "end": 725.18, "text": "They have to maintain blind faith."}, {"t": 725.18, "end": 729.18, "text": "But the master must not expose himself"}, {"t": 729.18, "end": 732.18, "text": "to public."}, {"t": 732.18, "end": 734.18, "text": "This is the way of Sūthras."}]}